    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "You can’t see it from here, but there\\n",
        "is a big city called Cianwood\\f",
        "across the sea."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "I took the ship to go to Olivine for\\n",
        "some sightseeing. I really liked\\f",
        "the atmosphere.\\r",
        "Being a port, it was nothing like\\n",
        "the big cities."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you know what lies just past\\n",
        "this gate?\\r",
        "It’s the Battle Frontier!\\r",
        "Every time I have a journey, I’ve\\n",
        "raised mostly “useful” Pokémon.\\r",
        "But now that I am here, I think I\\n",
        "should have brought my\\f",
        "“battle” Pokémon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey!\\n",
        "Great waves here!\\r",
        "No one can resist such\\n",
        "good waves!\\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "I see... You don’t have Surf yet...\\n",
        "This is just between you and me...\\r",
        "I got Surf from a man at Ecruteak,\\n",
        "and I think he’s still there.\\r",
        "Why don’t you try going there?\\r"
      ]
    },
